## SQ-IWF-01 | Immersive Weathering fast tick handler
@group B
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `[perf] Immersive Weathering`, `IwBlockGrowth`, `IwServerLevel`, `Mixin` errors
@pass One `callTick handler handler$...$callTick now calls IwGrowthFast.blockTick` line; no mixin error; `Loaded N block growths configurations` as before
@fails `not found` / `unknown signature` warning: IW's handler name or descriptor differs (javap the merged ServerLevel); crash at load: read the mixin error
@from batches/r1031/a1_boot.qb passed
bootexpect \[perf\] Immersive Weathering.*callTick
bootreject (?i)(IwBlockGrowth|IwServerLevel).*(error|fail|not found|unknown signature)

## SQ-IWF-02 | grass, flowers and leaf piles grow (fast path on; repeated on boot B1b with it off)
@group B
@commands In a plains area: `/fill` a 16x1x16 grass_block floor with air above, a 5x3x5 oak_leaves block 3 above air next to it; `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 300` for 60 s, then 3; count grass / flowers on the floor and leaf piles under the leaves. Repeat on a boot with `-Dcreativecommon.iwFastTick=false`
@pass Grass and flowers grow on the floor and leaf piles form, in both boots, counts of the same order
@fails Nothing in the fast boot only: the per-block tables were not filled (`IwGrowthFast.rebuilt` not called: check the `rebuild` RETURN inject)
@from batches/r1031/b1_gameplay.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (judge-3, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1031 b1_gameplay / w2_metas_spawns bot row
> execute unless entity qa run pbot spawn qa 0 120 0 minecraft:overworld creative
sleep 3
# PL located here since r1118 (judge-8, 2026-11-18): no row of the section captured it (Expected integer on every fill)
> execute positioned 0 70 0 run locate biome minecraft:plains
waitlog nearest minecraft:plains is at 300
capture PL nearest minecraft:plains is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {PL1} 150 {PL3}
sleep 20
> fill {PL1-8} 160 {PL3-8} {PL1+8} 160 {PL3+8} minecraft:grass_block
> fill {PL1-8} 161 {PL3-8} {PL1+8} 163 {PL3+8} minecraft:air
> fill {PL1+10} 160 {PL3-2} {PL1+14} 160 {PL3+2} minecraft:stone
> fill {PL1+10} 164 {PL3-2} {PL1+14} 166 {PL3+2} minecraft:oak_leaves[persistent=false,distance=1]
> fill {PL1+12} 164 {PL3} {PL1+12} 166 {PL3} minecraft:oak_log
> tp qa {PL1} 161 {PL3-12}
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> cdevtest count {PL1-8} 161 {PL3-8} {PL1+8} 161 {PL3+8} minecraft:grass
> cdevtest count {PL1-8} 161 {PL3-8} {PL1+8} 161 {PL3+8} minecraft:tall_grass
> cdevtest count {PL1+10} 161 {PL3-2} {PL1+14} 163 {PL3+2} immersive_weathering:oak_leaf_pile
> cdevtest count {PL1+10} 164 {PL3-2} {PL1+14} 166 {PL3+2} minecraft:oak_leaves
look grass/tall grass above 0 on the floor and leaf piles above 0 (about 10 expected: 72 leaves x 1000/4096 x 1200 x 0.0005); leaves still about 72 (the log keeps them from decaying, so the piles come from IW's block-tick growth, the fast path, not from decay); record the numbers for B1b
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-IWF-03 | snowy stone or icicles in a snowy biome in thunder
@phase worldgen
@group B
@commands Snowy biome (`/locate biome minecraft:snowy_plains`): `/weather thunder`, `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 300` 60 s; look for snowy stone and icicles near exposed stone; then `/weather clear`
@pass Snow-covered stone or icicles appear (universal snow growths through the sky tick)
@fails None: the universal table is empty, check `universal[]` after rebuild
@from batches/r1031/b1_gameplay.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (judge-3, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1031 b1_gameplay / w2_metas_spawns bot row
> execute unless entity qa run pbot spawn qa 0 120 0 minecraft:overworld creative
sleep 3
> execute positioned 0 70 0 run locate biome minecraft:snowy_plains
waitlog nearest minecraft:snowy_plains is at 300
capture SN is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {SN1} 150 {SN3}
sleep 20
> weather thunder
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 300
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> weather clear
> cdevtest count {SN1-32} 40 {SN3-32} {SN1+32} 89 {SN3+32} immersive_weathering:icicle
> cdevtest count {SN1-32} 90 {SN3-32} {SN1+32} 140 {SN3+32} immersive_weathering:icicle
> cdevtest count {SN1-32} 40 {SN3-32} {SN1+32} 89 {SN3+32} immersive_weathering:snowy_stone
