reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
look the counts (two y bands per block; the random ticks go through the level's chunk tick on purpose: that is the IW sky-tick path, so no /cdevtest randomtick here)

## SQ-IWF-04 | block_growths off: no grass, flowers or leaf piles from growths (boot B1c)
@group B
@commands `/stop`; set `block_growths = false` in `config/immersive_weathering-common.toml`; boot; SQ-IWF-02 setup again; then restore `true`
@pass No grass, flowers or leaf piles from growths (leaf piles still come from decay)
@fails Growths run: the switch is not read (`growthsOn`)
@from batches/r1031/b1_iwf.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
